m the picture below that $F$ assists the motion of the particle as it moves from $B$ to $A.$\n\n![](images/22/2287c33ff81973bcaef70917452c97282e0d0dd9ef06141d5beee8b53dec5836.png)\n\n \nSo, ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\""} {:db/id 17592186275259 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d72127a-90d6-5f7e-bd87-75d03285a918" :knowledge-point/title "Interpreting the Sign of a Line Integral Over a Non-Constant Vector Field"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6861910f-6d1e-51d4-89aa-e94ccdc1daef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186464408} {:answer/id #uuid "2ff3e9d8-9224-590f-a556-21e0f19a6cd9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186464409}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "6861910f-6d1e-51d4-89aa-e94ccdc1daef" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186464408} :answer-field/id #uuid "a2d825a4-6901-57a2-9930-5d754820d8f2" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186465138} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3073e19f-2806-5672-b534-cfe2db245ac2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186464410} {:answer/id #uuid "090dcb5c-5958-5538-8b54-75141969de9f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186464411}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "090dcb5c-5958-5538-8b54-75141969de9f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186464411} :answer-field/id #uuid "a6c59f83-3272-51a6-b5bb-233286cf4fae" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186465139} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4f071eee-8c41-5a00-9649-943ecfb7e8f8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186464412} {:answe