orientation of $C,$ then the situation with regards to the work done by $F$ is similar to the previous case.\n\n![](images/b2/b2bec1f1da172b623f20d28fd0e9c5a248cf00dc621769851ca33b3b545b8592.png)\n\n \nSo, ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only.\""} {:db/id 17592186414784 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d72127a-90d6-5f7e-bd87-75d03285a918" :knowledge-point/title "Interpreting the Sign of a Line Integral Over a Non-Constant Vector Field"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0f0162ba-5ef3-5ddf-8884-68e373c833a1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186472526} {:answer/id #uuid "10f070d6-ca76-58f9-8198-433b788e83cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186472527}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "10f070d6-ca76-58f9-8198-433b788e83cd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186472527} :answer-field/id #uuid "a22ff3ac-6762-5a5a-a846-c9c1ac079ce7" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186473658} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a55ad75-30aa-5338-9705-0e8bb5a17796" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186472528} {:answer/id #uuid "2bfb901c-eb55-5a16-8c43-2a7bc4df1694" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186472529}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4a55ad75-30aa-5338-9705-0e8bb5a17796" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186472528} :answer-field/id #uuid "3e84a8a1-9e86-5904-8f0e-d9bd26a8cf86" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186473659} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cf9bee40-6700-53ec-bc0a-8c4fbe9bdd4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186472530} {:answer/id #uuid "35fcedff-2ccf-5690-9d0e-4989e5420282" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186472531}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "cf9bee40-6700-53ec-bc0a-8c4fbe9bdd4a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186472530} :answer-field/id #uuid "1a2b2811-e1ba-5e92-bdc1-f1a06a417ca6" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186473660}] :question/difficulty {:db/id 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "277ca4a2-1c02-58e4-b62f-d0e1176e96df" :question/math-academy-id "q-125499" :question/problem "![](images/8f/8ffc97d4fc442503eb5b59e01f317cc7a77cf57d041e16807aa0645f962a5aeb.png)\n\nConsider the vector field $F(x,y)$ shown above. Let $C$ be the path where the three-quarter circle is traversed from $A$ to $B.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\n- ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0$\n- ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0$\n- ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Remember that ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r$ gives the total work done by a force $F$ in moving a particle along $C:$\n\n- If the force works *with* the motion of the particle (i.e., the force helps to push the particle along the path), then ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0.$\n\n- If the force works *against* the motion of the particle (i.e., the force impedes the motion of the particle as it moves along the path), then ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement.\n\n- Statement I is true while statement II is false. It's clear from the picture below that $F$ assists the motion of the particle as it moves from $A$ to $B.$\n\n![](images/c9/c9805268d9f4984983c3cc5e2200a0c22d804bc67076a3505ad35471693c037b.png)\n\n \nSo, ${\\int }_{C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0.$\n\n- Statement III is false. It's clear from the picture below that $F$ works against the motion of the particle as it moves from $B$ to $A.$\n\n![](images/da/dafb4d468e7711a804a5141301a02331bb5c7900f018a8ecdb6fd382bc05b799.png)\n\n \nSo, ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""} {:db/id 17592186414786 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d72127a-90d6-5f7e-bd87-75d03285a918" :knowledge-point/title "Interpreting the Sign of a Line Integral Over a Non-Constant Vector Field"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "862b5ba7-c160-5733-9f50-a71ae76ca34b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186472544} {:answer/id #uuid "e41ef8d6-645f-5335-a725-5df3f79d720b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186472545}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "862b5ba7-c160-5733-9f50-a71ae76ca34b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186472544} :answer-field/id #uuid "e6758123-2b6f-5ca7-b758-0977ff127c63" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186473667} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "87432ad0-fee2-5a6d-93c2-e0fdd6855b6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186472546} {:answer/id #uuid "a81d96e7-72a4-5890-9d53-4c56d8d05129" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186472547}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a81d96e7-72a4-5890-9d53-4c56d8d05129" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id 17592186472547} :answer-field/id #uuid "7218a528-433c-5908-a059-6caac226974f" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id 17592186473668} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e9d4872-a5a3-5eb5-a69c-5fd7c7c550ae" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id 17592186472548} {:answer/id #uuid "90531cfb-e714-59c4-8c1c-847269447